msgid "This personal build keeps cruise-speed behavior aligned with CarrotPilot. SunnyPilot ICBM, SCC-V, SCC-M, and Dynamic Experimental Control stay hidden and forced off; use Carrot and Speed Limit settings for staged experiments."
msgstr "这个个人版的巡航控速逻辑以 CarrotPilot 为准。SunnyPilot 的 ICBM、SCC-V、SCC-M 和动态实验控制会隐藏并强制关闭；分阶段测试请使用 Carrot 和限速设置。"

msgid "This personal build keeps cruise-speed behavior aligned with CarrotPilot. SunnyPilot ICBM, SCC-V, and SCC-M stay hidden and forced off. Sunny DEC is available as an off-by-default advanced option in Carrot settings."
msgstr "这个个人版的巡航控速逻辑以 CarrotPilot 为准。SunnyPilot 的 ICBM、SCC-V 和 SCC-M 会隐藏并强制关闭。Sunny DEC 作为高级纵向候选功能放在 Carrot 设置里，默认关闭。"

msgid "OPEN"
msgstr "打开"

msgid "Speed Limit, Maps, and Navigation"
msgstr "限速、地图和导航"

msgid "Phone/APN/N, vehicle, and map speed-limit behavior. Map overlay stays optional and does not become speed truth by default."
msgstr "管理手机/APN/N、车机和地图限速。地图覆盖层只是可选显示，默认不会作为限速真值。"

msgid "Cruise and Longitudinal Control"
msgstr "巡航和纵向控制"

msgid "Cruise distance, stop distance, lead behavior, Sunny DEC candidate mode, and locked high-risk Carrot control outputs."
msgstr "管理跟车、刹停、前车响应、Sunny DEC 候选模式，以及锁定的 Carrot 高风险控制项。"

msgid "Auto-Tuner"
msgstr "Auto-Tuner"

msgid "Local learning, recommendation apply gates, and tuning history. Auto apply remains off by default."
msgstr "本地学习、建议应用门禁和调参历史。自动应用默认关闭。"

msgid "Steering and Path"
msgstr "转向和路径"

msgid "Path offset and steering response values used by the Carrot tuning workflow."
msgstr "Carrot 调参流程使用的路径偏移和转向响应参数。"

msgid "Fishop Hardware"
msgstr "Fishop 硬件"

msgid "Lane curve, lidar lane data, blindspot, navigation gate, and auto-overtake evidence. Control output remains locked."
msgstr "车道曲线、激光雷达车道数据、盲区、导航门禁和自动超车证据。控制输出仍然锁定。"

msgid "Local Web and Evidence"
msgstr "本地 Web 和证据"

msgid "Local Carrot Web/API, branch conflict notes, and safe testing reminders. This is local LAN, not cloud pairing."
msgstr "本地 Carrot Web/API、分支冲突说明和安全测试提醒。这是局域网功能，不是云配对。"

msgid "Sunny DEC Dynamic Experimental Control"
msgstr "Sunny DEC 动态实验控制"

msgid "Candidate advanced longitudinal mode from SunnyPilot. Default is Off. It may switch between classic longitudinal and experimental/E2E behavior, so do not combine it with unvalidated Carrot active speed, turn slowdown, or traffic-light stop outputs."
msgstr "来自 SunnyPilot 的高级纵向候选模式，默认关闭。它可能在传统纵向和实验/E2E 行为之间切换，所以不要和未验证的 Carrot 主动控速、转弯减速或红绿灯停车输出一起使用。"

msgid "Stop Distance"
msgstr "刹停距离"

msgid "Carrot stop-distance target used by the tuning workflow. Keep your known-good value until braking logs are reviewed."
msgstr "Carrot 调参使用的刹停距离目标。刹车日志复核前，保持你当前能用的值。"

msgid "Dynamic Following"
msgstr "动态跟车"

msgid "Dynamic following strength. This is a tuning target and should be changed slowly after log review."
msgstr "动态跟车强度。这是调参目标，建议复核日志后小幅调整。"

msgid "Deceleration Follow Boost"
msgstr "减速跟车增强"

msgid "Extra follow-distance behavior during deceleration. Higher values can feel more conservative."
msgstr "减速时额外增加跟车余量。数值越高通常越保守。"

msgid "Follow Gap 1"
msgstr "跟车间距 1"

msgid "Follow Gap 2"
msgstr "跟车间距 2"

msgid "Follow Gap 3"
msgstr "跟车间距 3"

msgid "Follow Gap 4"
msgstr "跟车间距 4"

msgid "Time gap preset 1 used by Carrot tuning."
msgstr "Carrot 调参使用的跟车时间预设 1。"

msgid "Time gap preset 2 used by Carrot tuning."
msgstr "Carrot 调参使用的跟车时间预设 2。"

msgid "Time gap preset 3 used by Carrot tuning."
msgstr "Carrot 调参使用的跟车时间预设 3。"

msgid "Time gap preset 4 used by Carrot tuning."
msgstr "Carrot 调参使用的跟车时间预设 4。"

msgid "Cruise Accel Limit 0"
msgstr "巡航加速限制 0"

msgid "Cruise Accel Limit 1"
msgstr "巡航加速限制 1"

msgid "Cruise Accel Limit 2"
msgstr "巡航加速限制 2"

msgid "Cruise Accel Limit 3"
msgstr "巡航加速限制 3"

msgid "Cruise Accel Limit 4"
msgstr "巡航加速限制 4"

msgid "Cruise Accel Limit 5"
msgstr "巡航加速限制 5"

msgid "Cruise Accel Limit 6"
msgstr "巡航加速限制 6"

msgid "Carrot cruise acceleration table entry. Preserve known-good values unless Auto-Tuner recommends a change."
msgstr "Carrot 巡航加速表项目。除非 Auto-Tuner 给出建议，否则保留当前能用的值。"

msgid "Lead Response Factor"
msgstr "前车响应系数"

msgid "Lead-vehicle response tuning target. Change only after comparing braking and lead-distance logs."
msgstr "前车响应调参目标。只有比较刹车和前车距离日志后再调整。"

msgid "Apply Pending Recommendation"
msgstr "应用待处理建议"

msgid "Manual apply is blocked while onroad. Review the recommendation first; this changes stored tuning values."
msgstr "行驶中禁止手动应用。请先确认建议内容；这会修改保存的调参值。"

msgid "Apply pending Auto-Tuner recommendation?"
msgstr "应用当前 Auto-Tuner 建议？"

msgid "Ignore Pending Recommendation"
msgstr "忽略待处理建议"

msgid "Clear the current recommendation without changing tuning values."
msgstr "清除当前建议，不修改调参值。"

msgid "Ignore the pending Auto-Tuner recommendation?"
msgstr "忽略当前 Auto-Tuner 建议？"

msgid "Clear Learning Data"
msgstr "清除学习数据"

msgid "Clear collected Auto-Tuner learning data and pending recommendations. Historical applied records are kept unless factory reset is used."
msgstr "清除已收集的 Auto-Tuner 学习数据和待处理建议。除非使用恢复出厂，否则已应用历史会保留。"

msgid "Clear Auto-Tuner learning data?"
msgstr "清除 Auto-Tuner 学习数据？"

msgid "Factory Reset Tuning History"
msgstr "重置调参历史"

msgid "Clear Auto-Tuner history and recommendations. This does not restore every driving parameter by itself."
msgstr "清除 Auto-Tuner 历史和建议。它不会自动恢复所有驾驶参数。"

msgid "Factory reset Auto-Tuner history?"
msgstr "重置 Auto-Tuner 历史？"

msgid "Path Offset"
msgstr "路径偏移"

msgid "Lane/path lateral offset used by Carrot tuning. Zero is neutral; keep your known-good value unless testing carefully."
msgstr "Carrot 调参使用的车道/路径横向偏移。0 为中性；除非认真测试，否则保留当前能用的值。"

msgid "Steer Actuator Delay"
msgstr "转向执行延迟"

msgid "Additional steering actuator delay target used by Auto-Tuner. Change only while parked and after reviewing logs."
msgstr "Auto-Tuner 使用的额外转向执行延迟目标。只在停车并复核日志后调整。"

msgid "Steer Ratio Rate"
msgstr "转向比例缩放"

msgid "Steering ratio scaling target. 100 is neutral."
msgstr "转向比例缩放目标。100 为中性。"

msgid "Branch Conflict Notes"
msgstr "分支冲突说明"

msgid "Sunny DEC is a candidate advanced longitudinal feature. ICBM, SCC-V, and SCC-M overlap more directly with Carrot cruise behavior and remain hidden or inert in this personal alpha."
msgstr "Sunny DEC 是高级纵向候选功能。ICBM、SCC-V 和 SCC-M 与 Carrot 巡航逻辑重叠更直接，在这个个人 alpha 中继续隐藏或保持无效。"

msgid "Conflict policy: keep Sunny DEC as an off-by-default candidate; keep ICBM, SCC-V, and SCC-M hidden or inert because they can overlap with Carrot button, curve, map, and speed-limit control paths."
msgstr "冲突策略：Sunny DEC 作为默认关闭的候选功能保留；ICBM、SCC-V 和 SCC-M 可能与 Carrot 按键、弯道、地图和限速控制路径重叠，因此保持隐藏或无效。"

msgid "Phone Speed Limit Source"
msgstr "手机限速来源"

msgid "Use fresh APN/N, Navipilot, or Carrot phone speed-limit data before the vehicle and map sources. Stale phone data times out automatically."
msgstr "优先使用新鲜的 APN/N、Navipilot 或 Carrot 手机限速数据，再回退到车机和地图来源。过期手机数据会自动超时。"

msgid "Carrot Map Overlay"
msgstr "Carrot 地图覆盖层"

msgid "Show the optional Carrot route/map overlay. Default is Off; when Off, external map SDKs and map iframes are not loaded."
msgstr "显示可选的 Carrot 路线/地图覆盖层。默认关闭；关闭时不会加载外部地图 SDK 或地图 iframe。"

msgid "Auto-Tuner Learning"
msgstr "Auto-Tuner 学习"

msgid "Collect local driving evidence and prepare tuning recommendations. This does not apply changes by itself."
msgstr "收集本地驾驶证据并生成调参建议。它本身不会自动应用修改。"

msgid "Auto-Tuner Auto Apply"
msgstr "Auto-Tuner 自动应用"

msgid "Default is Off. Auto-apply is available only while parked and should stay Off until recommendations are reviewed after real drives."
msgstr "默认关闭。自动应用只允许在停车时使用，并且在实车行驶后人工确认建议前应保持关闭。"

msgid "Apply Lateral Recommendations"
msgstr "应用横向建议"

msgid "Apply Longitudinal Recommendations"
msgstr "应用纵向建议"

msgid "Fishop Lane Curve Input"
msgstr "Fishop 车道曲线输入"

msgid "Fishop Lidar Blindspot Input"
msgstr "Fishop 激光雷达盲区输入"

msgid "Fishop Lidar Lane Data Input"
msgstr "Fishop 激光雷达车道数据输入"

msgid "Carrot Active Speed Control"
msgstr "Carrot 主动速度控制"

msgid "Carrot Auto Turn Slowdown"
msgstr "Carrot 自动转弯减速"

msgid "Carrot Traffic Light Stop"
msgstr "Carrot 红绿灯停车"

msgid "Use fresh APN/N, Navipilot, or Carrot phone speed-limit data before vehicle and map sources. Stale data times out automatically."
msgstr "优先使用新鲜的 APN/N、Navipilot 或 Carrot 手机限速数据，再回退到车机和地图来源。过期数据会自动超时。"

msgid "Allow Carrot speed-limit, navigation, SDI, speed-bump, traffic-light, and model-speed evidence to adjust cruise targets when the related assist mode is enabled."
msgstr "在相关辅助模式启用时，允许 Carrot 使用限速、导航、SDI、减速带、红绿灯和模型速度证据调整巡航目标。"

msgid "Deceleration strength for navigation speed events such as turns, speed cameras, speed bumps, and model-speed limits."
msgstr "导航速度事件的减速强度，例如转弯、测速点、减速带和模型速度限制。"

msgid "Speed Limit And Model-Speed"
msgstr "限速与模型速度"

msgid "Phone speed, vehicle speed, map speed, and model-speed evidence stay visible here; detailed source policy is inside Speed Limit."
msgstr "手机限速、车机限速、地图限速和模型速度证据集中放在这里；详细来源策略在“限速”里设置。"

msgid "Curve And Turn Slowdown"
msgstr "弯道与转弯减速"

msgid "Sunny curve quality, Carrot navigation turns, lane-line curve input, and model-speed events are selected by explicit modes."
msgstr "Sunny 弯道质量、Carrot 导航转弯、车道线曲率输入和模型速度事件都通过明确模式选择。"

msgid "Traffic Light Stop"
msgstr "红绿灯停车"

msgid "Red-light behavior remains a separate Carrot gate and should be tested independently."
msgstr "红灯停车仍然是独立的 Carrot 开关，应单独测试。"

msgid "Longitudinal Behavior"
msgstr "纵向控制行为"

msgid "DEC is separate from Carrot speed logic; the Carrot decel and following values remain user-tuneable while parked."
msgstr "DEC 与 Carrot 速度逻辑分开；Carrot 减速和跟车数值仍可在停车状态下调整。"

msgid "Cruise Button Behavior"
msgstr "巡航按键行为"

msgid "Button behavior stays limited to local cruise-speed increment settings. ICBM/SCC-V/SCC-M remain hidden because they overlap Carrot cruise logic."
msgstr "按键行为仅限本地巡航速度步进设置。ICBM/SCC-V/SCC-M 与 Carrot 巡航逻辑重叠，因此继续隐藏。"

msgid "Button behavior is limited to local cruise-speed increment settings. Curve, map, navigation, and traffic-light behavior are handled by the staged Carrot controls above."
msgstr "按键行为仅限本地巡航速度步进设置。弯道、地图、导航和红绿灯行为由上方分阶段的 Carrot 控制项处理。"

msgid "Fishop Auto Overtake"
msgstr "Fishop 自动超车"

msgid "Locked Off in this alpha. The resolver can show speed-limit evidence, but this control-output path is not enabled yet."
msgstr "此 alpha 版本锁定关闭。解析器可以显示限速证据，但控制输出路径尚未启用。"

msgid "Locked Off in this alpha. Turn/curve evidence can be collected, but automatic slowdown must be validated separately."
msgstr "此 alpha 版本锁定关闭。可以收集转弯/弯道证据，但自动减速必须单独验证。"

msgid "Locked Off in this alpha. Traffic-light stop logic is not allowed to command braking until separate real-car validation is complete."
msgstr "此 alpha 版本锁定关闭。红绿灯停车逻辑在完成单独实车验证前，不允许指令制动。"

msgid "Locked Off in this alpha. Lane and blindspot hardware can be logged, but automatic overtaking is not connected to control output."
msgstr "此 alpha 版本锁定关闭。车道和盲区硬件可以记录数据，但自动超车不会连接到控制输出。"

msgid "Local Carrot Web"
msgstr "本地 Carrot Web"

msgid "Use the device LAN address with port 7000 for the local Carrot Web/API page. This is a local service, not cloud pairing."
msgstr "使用设备局域网地址加 7000 端口访问本地 Carrot Web/API 页面。这是本地服务，不是云端配对。"

msgid "Developer UI"
msgstr "开发者信息显示"

msgid "Display real-time parameters and metrics from various sources."
msgstr "显示来自不同模块的实时参数和指标。"

msgid "Display Metrics Below Chevron"
msgstr "在前车标记下方显示指标"

msgid "Show Blind Spot Warnings"
msgstr "显示盲区警告"

msgid "Steering Arc"
msgstr "转向弧线"

msgid "Display steering arc on the driving screen when lateral control is enabled."
msgstr "横向控制启用时，在驾驶画面显示转向弧线。"

msgid "Real-time Acceleration Bar"
msgstr "实时加减速条"

msgid "Show an indicator on the left side of the screen to display real-time vehicle acceleration and deceleration. This displays what the car is currently doing, not what the planner is requesting."
msgstr "在屏幕左侧显示车辆实时加速/减速状态。它显示车辆当前正在做什么，而不是规划器正在请求什么。"

msgid "Super Advanced"
msgstr "Super Advanced"

msgid "This personal build keeps cruise-speed behavior aligned with CarrotPilot. SunnyPilot ICBM, SCC-V, and SCC-M stay hidden and forced off. Sunny DEC is available as an off-by-default advanced option in Cruise and Super Advanced settings."
msgstr "这个个人版的巡航控速逻辑以 CarrotPilot 为准。SunnyPilot 的 ICBM、SCC-V 和 SCC-M 会隐藏并强制关闭。Sunny DEC 作为默认关闭的高级候选功能放在 Cruise 和 Super Advanced 设置里。"

msgid "Genius Lane Change Visuals"
msgstr "Genius 变道可视化"

msgid "Show lane-change intent cues on the driving screen using the model lane-change events. This is display-only."
msgstr "使用模型变道事件，在驾驶画面显示变道意图提示。此功能只影响显示。"

msgid "Fishop Visual Overlay"
msgstr "Fishop 可视化叠加"

msgid "Draw Fishop lane, lidar lane, blindspot, and overtake suggestion evidence on top of any visual preset only while the local hardware data is fresh. This does not enable automatic overtake control."
msgstr "在任意显示预设上叠加 Fishop 车道、激光雷达车道、盲区和超车建议证据；只有本地硬件数据新鲜时才会显示。它不会启用自动超车控制。"

msgid "Carrot World Overlay"
msgstr "Carrot 世界叠加层"

msgid "Draw Carrot-style side-lane, blindspot, lane-change, lead, and radar evidence on top of the selected visual preset. This is display-only and does not change lane-change or control decisions."
msgstr "在当前显示预设上叠加 Carrot 风格的侧向车道、盲区、变道、前车和雷达证据。此功能只影响显示，不会改变变道或控制决策。"

msgid "Genius Visualization Preset"
msgstr "Genius 可视化预设"

msgid "Choose one base display preset. Sunny is minimal, Carrot emphasizes lane, path, lead, and radar information, and Balanced keeps the Sunny HUD with Carrot-style lane and path cues. Fishop and Carrot World overlays are independent top layers."
msgstr "选择一个基础显示预设。Sunny 最简洁，Carrot 强化车道、路径、前车和雷达信息，平衡模式保留 Sunny HUD，并叠加 Carrot 风格车道和路径提示。Fishop 和 Carrot World 是独立的上层叠加显示。"

msgid "Lane-Line Style"
msgstr "车道线样式"

msgid "Simple uses white lanes and red road edges. Colored highlights active lane confidence. Carrot adds stronger adjacent-lane emphasis and torque color cues."
msgstr "Simple 使用白色车道线和红色道路边缘。Colored 突出显示车道置信度。Carrot 会加强相邻车道显示，并加入转向力矩颜色提示。"

msgid "Lead And Radar Display"
msgstr "前车和雷达显示"

msgid "Chevron uses Sunny's lead marker. Box draws a Carrot-style lead-car frame. Radar also shows speed labels for tracked leads."
msgstr "Chevron 使用 Sunny 的前车标记。Box 绘制 Carrot 风格前车框。Radar 还会给跟踪到的前车显示速度标签。"

msgid "Base Display Layer"
msgstr "基础显示层"

msgid "Only one base road renderer is active at a time."
msgstr "同一时间只启用一个基础道路渲染器。"

msgid "Visual Detail Controls"
msgstr "显示细节控制"

msgid "These refine the selected preset without changing planner or lane-change behavior."
msgstr "这些设置只细化当前预设，不改变规划器或变道控制行为。"

msgid "Evidence Overlays"
msgstr "证据叠加层"

msgid "Carrot World and Fishop are independent display-only overlays. They may be enabled together on top of any base preset when you need lane-change or hardware evidence."
msgstr "Carrot World 和 Fishop 是独立的显示叠加层。需要查看变道或硬件证据时，它们可以同时叠加在任意基础预设上。"

msgid "General HUD Widgets"
msgstr "普通 HUD 小组件"

msgid "These are normal Sunny/Genius HUD widgets and do not select the base road renderer."
msgstr "这些是普通 Sunny/Genius HUD 小组件，不负责选择基础道路渲染器。"

msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "平衡"

msgid "Select the curve-speed strategy: Off, Sunny, Carrot, or Balanced. Balanced keeps Sunny curve quality and Carrot navigation/phone inputs together."
msgstr "选择弯道控速策略：关闭、Sunny、Carrot 或平衡。平衡模式会同时使用 Sunny 的模型弯道能力和 Carrot 的导航/手机输入。"

msgid "Select the curve-speed strategy: Off, Sunny, Carrot, or Balanced. Balanced keeps Sunny model-curvature quality and Carrot navigation/phone/lane inputs together."
msgstr "选择弯道控速策略：关闭、Sunny、Carrot 或平衡。平衡模式会同时使用 Sunny 的模型曲率能力，以及 Carrot 的导航、手机和车道输入。"

msgid "Select the turn-speed strategy: Off, Carrot, Sunny, or Balanced."
msgstr "选择转弯控速策略：关闭、Carrot、Sunny 或平衡。"

msgid "Curve Speed Factor"
msgstr "弯道速度因子"

msgid "Main Carrot curve-speed scaling value. Higher values make curve detection more sensitive, usually lowering the curve target speed and slowing earlier. If the lower-limit speed is already reached, raising this may have no further effect."
msgstr "Carrot 弯道速度主缩放值。数值越高，对弯道越敏感，通常会降低弯道目标速度并更早减速。如果已经降到最低弯道速度，继续调高可能不会再产生效果。"

msgid "Curve Speed Aggressiveness"
msgstr "弯道速度激进度"

msgid "Secondary Carrot-compatible curve knob. Current active curve slowdown primarily uses Curve Speed Factor; keep this near 100 unless a later controller or Auto-Tuner recommendation explicitly uses it."
msgstr "兼容 Carrot 的次级弯道旋钮。当前主动弯道减速主要使用弯道速度因子；除非后续控制器或 Auto-Tuner 明确建议使用，否则建议保持在 100 附近。"

msgid "Navigation Decel Rate"
msgstr "导航减速比例"

msgid "Navigation-event deceleration scale. Lower values start slowing from farther away; higher values delay the slowdown and can feel later/stronger."
msgstr "导航事件减速比例。数值越低，会从更远处开始减速；数值越高，会推迟减速，体感可能更晚也更强。"

msgid "Cruise Accel Limit 0 km/h"
msgstr "巡航加速度上限 0 km/h"

msgid "Cruise Accel Limit 10 km/h"
msgstr "巡航加速度上限 10 km/h"

msgid "Cruise Accel Limit 40 km/h"
msgstr "巡航加速度上限 40 km/h"

msgid "Cruise Accel Limit 60 km/h"
msgstr "巡航加速度上限 60 km/h"

msgid "Cruise Accel Limit 80 km/h"
msgstr "巡航加速度上限 80 km/h"

msgid "Cruise Accel Limit 110 km/h"
msgstr "巡航加速度上限 110 km/h"

msgid "Cruise Accel Limit 140 km/h"
msgstr "巡航加速度上限 140 km/h"

msgid "Maximum requested cruise acceleration near 80 km/h, in 0.01 m/s^2 units. Higher feels stronger; preserve known-good values unless Auto-Tuner recommends a change."
msgstr "80 km/h 附近的巡航请求加速度上限，单位为 0.01 m/s^2。数值越高加速越强；除非 Auto-Tuner 明确建议，否则建议保留已知可用值。"

msgid "Maximum requested cruise acceleration near 0 km/h, in 0.01 m/s^2 units. Higher feels stronger; preserve known-good values unless Auto-Tuner recommends a change."
msgstr "0 km/h 附近的巡航请求加速度上限，单位为 0.01 m/s^2。数值越高加速越强；除非 Auto-Tuner 明确建议，否则建议保留已知可用值。"

msgid "Maximum requested cruise acceleration near 10 km/h, in 0.01 m/s^2 units. Higher feels stronger; preserve known-good values unless Auto-Tuner recommends a change."
msgstr "10 km/h 附近的巡航请求加速度上限，单位为 0.01 m/s^2。数值越高加速越强；除非 Auto-Tuner 明确建议，否则建议保留已知可用值。"

msgid "Maximum requested cruise acceleration near 40 km/h, in 0.01 m/s^2 units. Higher feels stronger; preserve known-good values unless Auto-Tuner recommends a change."
msgstr "40 km/h 附近的巡航请求加速度上限，单位为 0.01 m/s^2。数值越高加速越强；除非 Auto-Tuner 明确建议，否则建议保留已知可用值。"

msgid "Maximum requested cruise acceleration near 60 km/h, in 0.01 m/s^2 units. Higher feels stronger; preserve known-good values unless Auto-Tuner recommends a change."
msgstr "60 km/h 附近的巡航请求加速度上限，单位为 0.01 m/s^2。数值越高加速越强；除非 Auto-Tuner 明确建议，否则建议保留已知可用值。"

msgid "Maximum requested cruise acceleration near 110 km/h, in 0.01 m/s^2 units. Higher feels stronger; preserve known-good values unless Auto-Tuner recommends a change."
msgstr "110 km/h 附近的巡航请求加速度上限，单位为 0.01 m/s^2。数值越高加速越强；除非 Auto-Tuner 明确建议，否则建议保留已知可用值。"

msgid "Maximum requested cruise acceleration near 140 km/h, in 0.01 m/s^2 units. Higher feels stronger; preserve known-good values unless Auto-Tuner recommends a change."
msgstr "140 km/h 附近的巡航请求加速度上限，单位为 0.01 m/s^2。数值越高加速越强；除非 Auto-Tuner 明确建议，否则建议保留已知可用值。"

msgid "Longitudinal Kp"
msgstr "纵向 Kp"

msgid "Carrot longitudinal proportional gain. Higher reacts harder to speed error; lower can reduce overshoot or oscillation."
msgstr "Carrot 纵向比例增益。数值越高，对速度误差反应越强；数值降低可减少超调或震荡。"

msgid "Long Actuator Delay"
msgstr "纵向执行器延迟"

msgid "Longitudinal actuator delay in 0.01 s units. Higher anticipates slower actuator response; too high may feel early."
msgstr "纵向执行器延迟，单位为 0.01 秒。数值越高表示预判执行器反应更慢；过高可能会感觉动作过早。"

msgid "Stopping Speed Threshold"
msgstr "停车判定速度阈值"

msgid "Stopping detection threshold in 0.01 m/s units. Higher can smooth harsh stops; too high can enter stopping behavior early."
msgstr "停车判定速度阈值，单位为 0.01 m/s。数值调高可能缓和急停；过高可能过早进入停车逻辑。"

msgid "Lane/path lateral offset used by Carrot tuning. Zero is neutral; negative shifts left, positive shifts right."
msgstr "Carrot 调参使用的车道/路径横向偏移。0 为居中；负值向左偏，正值向右偏。"

msgid "Additional steering actuator delay target used by Auto-Tuner. Zero uses live/default delay; higher adds custom delay compensation."
msgstr "Auto-Tuner 使用的额外转向执行器延迟目标。0 使用实时/默认延迟；数值越高，自定义延迟补偿越多。"

msgid "Simple"
msgstr "简洁"

msgid "Colored"
msgstr "彩色"

msgid "Chevron"
msgstr "箭头"

msgid "Box"
msgstr "方框"

msgid "Radar"
msgstr "雷达"

msgid "Genius Pilot Local Mode"
msgstr "Genius Pilot 本地模式"

msgid "This personal build does not use Sunnylink or comma cloud pairing. Local Wi-Fi, SSH, Web, GitHub updates, and model downloads stay available."
msgstr "这个个人版不使用 Sunnylink 或 comma 云端配对。本地 Wi-Fi、SSH、Web、GitHub 更新和模型下载仍然可用。"

msgid "Cloud upload, remote pairing, Sunnylink backup, and onroad uploads are disabled in Genius Pilot C3 alpha."
msgstr "Genius Pilot C3 alpha 已禁用云端上传、远程配对、Sunnylink 备份和行驶中上传。"

msgid "Continue"
msgstr "继续"

msgid "Data Uploads Disabled"
msgstr "数据上传已关闭"

msgid ""
"Genius Pilot keeps cloud training uploads disabled in this personal C3 build.\n"
"\n"
"Local Wi-Fi, SSH, Web, GitHub updates, and model downloads remain available. Driving data is not uploaded from this page."
msgstr ""
"这个 Genius Pilot C3 个人版已关闭云端训练数据上传。\n"
"\n"
"本地 Wi-Fi、SSH、Web、GitHub 更新和模型下载仍然可用。此页面不会上传驾驶数据。"

msgid ""
"For updates, bring your device inside and connect to a good USB-C adapter and Wi-Fi.\n"
"\n"
"Use the Software, Models, and Super Advanced pages for local maintenance. This page does not pair with comma, Sunnylink, or any cloud upload service."
msgstr ""
"需要更新时，把设备带到室内并连接稳定的 USB-C 电源和 Wi-Fi。\n"
"\n"
"本地维护请使用 Software、Models 和 Super Advanced 页面。此页面不会与 comma、Sunnylink 或任何云端上传服务配对。"

msgid "Does this upload my drives?"
msgstr "这会上传我的驾驶数据吗？"

msgid "No. Cloud upload paths are disabled in Genius Pilot."
msgstr "不会。Genius Pilot 已禁用云端上传路径。"

msgid "Can I still update over Wi-Fi?"
msgstr "还能通过 Wi-Fi 更新吗？"

msgid "Yes. GitHub updates and model downloads are local maintenance features."
msgstr "可以。GitHub 更新和模型下载属于本地维护功能。"

msgid "What should I use this page for?"
msgstr "这个页面用来做什么？"

msgid "It is a reminder that cloud training upload mode is intentionally unavailable."
msgstr "它用于提示：云端训练上传模式在本版本中被有意关闭。"

msgid "DISABLED: cloud uploads are off in this personal build"
msgstr "已禁用：此个人版已关闭云端上传"

msgid "This personal build keeps cruise-speed behavior aligned with CarrotPilot. ICBM, SCC-V, and SCC-M stay hidden. Sunny DEC is available in Cruise and Super Advanced settings."
msgstr "这个个人版的巡航控速逻辑以 CarrotPilot 为准。ICBM、SCC-V 和 SCC-M 会隐藏。Sunny DEC 可在 Cruise 和 Super Advanced 设置中使用。"
